    "turn_text": "Congressman, Secretary Mayorkas was in front of the Senate and got us started talking to. And I know he's going to be in front of the house today. I'm not sure which committee it is. He's in front of, but it is oversight. Okay. You know, I know there have been calls for his impeachment. Senator Hawley certainly wasn't shy yesterday about suggesting that he should be impeached. How realistic is that? And will that ultimately accomplish much of anything with regard to getting the border under control?",
