    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "We're visiting with Congressman Mike Boston. Congressman, I want to switch to some legislation proposed that you're saying is going to protect U.S. companies from China's cheating. Now, define what China's cheating is and what is it that U.S. businesses need to be protected from.",
