        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "There exists a credible threat from China that undermines fair competition for U.S. firms.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Legislation can effectively address economic threats posed by foreign actors like China.",
        "confidence": 0.87
